      "circumference_integral_eq: FTC proof ∫₀ʳ 2πρ dρ = πr²",
      "tendsto_inscribed_to_pi_r_sq: inscribed n-gon → πr²",
      "exhaustion_equals_ftc: both methods converge to the same value",
      "inscribed_area_le_pi_r_sq: inscribed areas ≤ πr² (via sin(x) < x)",
      "two_methods_one_area: limit uniqueness theorem"
